  <section id="ccarf" class="bg-paper">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="shift-head">
        <span class="eyebrow on-light"><span class="dot"></span>THE CERT BLOCK · 12 MIN</span>
        <h2>Everything you just watched is on the exam</h2>
        <p>The <strong>Claude Certified Architect – Foundations</strong> (CCAR-F) is 60 items in 120 minutes, four scenarios drawn from a published bank of six, 720 out of 1000 to pass. It's scenario-based because the job is. Here's where each domain was standing.</p>
      </div>

