          <div class="dm-wt">20%<span>D3</span></div>
          <div>
            <h4 class="dm-name">Claude Code Configuration &amp; Workflows</h4>
            <p class="dm-desc">CLAUDE.md hierarchy, @path imports, .claude/rules globs, Skills, plan mode vs. direct execution, where MCP config lives. Convention-heavy and closed-book.</p>
          </div>
