        </div>

        <div class="dmap-row">
          <div class="dm-wt">20%<span>D4</span></div>
          <div>
            <h4 class="dm-name">Prompt Engineering &amp; Structured Output</h4>
            <p class="dm-desc">JSON schemas via tool use, required vs. optional fields, nullable types, open enums with an "other" and an "unclear" escape hatch, retry with error feedback.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="dm-where"><strong>Seen in</strong> Surfaces 01 and 04 — the JSONL schema, and the closed <code>fit_type</code> enum with nowhere to put an unclear answer.</div>
        </div>

        <div class="dmap-row">
          <div class="dm-wt">15%<span>D5</span></div>
          <div>
            <h4 class="dm-name">Context Management &amp; Reliability</h4>
            <p class="dm-desc">Trimming verbose output before it accumulates, the lost-in-the-middle effect, honest escalation, knowing when a retry can't help.</p>
          </div>
